ence over losing  in future presidential elections  capitol police chief thomas manger says  threats to lawmakers have accelerated  where does the threat level stand right  now it's exponentially higher than it  was five years ago it remains to be seen  if it just keeps increasing at the level  that it has increased or do we as a  country get to a point where enough  people say enough is enough  president biden and vice president  harris planned to speak here at the  capitol on thursday to mark the one-year  anniversary of january 6th former  president trump is planning a news  conference in mar-a-lago tony  yeah i don't often point to must-read  poll numbers but i think everyone should  go to our website and read the full  write-up on this poll chris thank you  very much for that report
 

